*particularly* since the group doesn't seem to actually have blatantly obscene
material in it, just discussions of "is pedophilia ok/evil", etc. 

Do the portray Tim Hester as obsessed to the point of lunacy about this,
as we've come to see in his postings?  Of course not.

Nothing like a little intentional ignorance of the facts. 

Well, I, for one, encourage anyone with a Post subscription to cancel it.
I encourage everyone to write letters of protest.  This is truly
pathetic "journalism".  Maybe the R.M.News is as bad, maybe they all are,
but I don't think we as readers should tolerate crap like this.

But, of course, the damage is done.  Now we can all just wait until the
misinformed and clueless masses start bitching to DU that "DU supports
pedophiles".

I'm not entirely sure what to suggest; the nail may already be in Nyx's
coffin when the DU admins themselves read this (presuming they get the
post, probably 50/50 chance one of the high-ups does), let alone when
the inevitable calls start arriving.
